WEBVTT

00:16:58.638 --> 00:17:00.265
of the human past,

00:17:00.640 --> 00:17:02.642
even to begin imagining

00:17:02.684 --> 00:17:06.938
what other kinds of civilization
we might create

00:17:06.938 --> 00:17:11.401
if we can just stop telling ourselves

00:17:11.443 --> 00:17:16.531
that this particular world
is the only one possible.

00:17:17.824 --> 00:17:18.992
Thank you very much.

00:17:19.034 --> 00:17:24.164
(Applause)